  "rationale": "Raid tuning of 2026-10-08 (PR #251, branch raid-tuning at 41d0b023, over main 945fb135). CONTENT: cast vigor fp(3) -> fp(0.1875) against every mage's fp(1); hit-point family /16 and node.json direct-damage x4; summon blow /64; portal 150 +/- 30 ticks; stand-in rival armed with 2 nodes a raider, one primitive per slot, instead of 8. CODE: a raid ends on its own terms only once no raider is on the field (no stranding on the last objective or the last defender); action 14 and 16 count only usably held portal nodes (mastery >= activation), and 14 also needs a living raider and a seat holding a running universe; raid-readiness drills a raider's held combat/theft/portal nodes (raiders only); a raid's own casualties are settled like ordinary deaths (goal, lessons, workings, affiliation). Every run here is raided by stand-ins, which before could not kill and now kill about three mages an arrival (scripts/standin-lethality-probe.mjs: 0 -> 42 deaths in 14 arrivals, six seeds, 600 ticks). The movement is that behaviour landing on purpose, not a regression.",
